# Brill: The Reclamation Library (mod-brill-home, tools/town/library.py), ChromieCraft's realm: Brill Endures
# granted (the project's stage 1, <4:1>: the library's stages are invisibility kind 4), Edmund Rook at the old
# customs office on Stillhome Lane. More Than Ashes (the counter, the flooded cellar, the record chest, a book
# at Garren's Haunt, Magistrate Sevren's leave); Shelves for the Dead (hardwood west of town, Rudd Carver's
# hinges, Abigail Shiel's parchment, the shelves and the cellar window); The Names We Carried (Royal Overseer
# Bauhaus's census in the Undercity, the Agamand mill's ledger, Thomas Arlento, Mrs. Winters and Doreen
# Beltis); The Missing Chapter (the Scarlet record store at Solliden, a collector, a page, Edmund's
# worktable); An Open Book (an invitation, the last table, a pile sorted, the child's slate donated: the mark
# q971213). Each quest moves the stage on; then the library open (<4:6>), the house's library set bought from
# Tobias (<4:7>, the mark q971217) and the daily, Lost Pages, offered. (The long counts are filled with
# .quest complete.)
cmd .levelup 11
cmd .modify money 100000
cmd .brilltown grant 971000
# Stage 1: Edmund at the customs office's yard.
go 0 2235.5 341.2 35.7
wait 2
cmd .brilltown state
has <4:1>
talk 971200
accept 971200 971200
